Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-epgtoxml
Version: @VERSION@
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Arcardy
Homepage: https://github.com/Arcardus/epgtoxml
Depends: enigma2, python-core, python-json, python-xml, python-compression, python-netclient, python-twisted-core, python-twisted-web, python-six
Description: Task-based EPG importer for Enigma2 (Sky.de, DAZN)
 EpgToXml fetches EPG data from modular providers (currently Sky.de and
 DAZN Live-TV) and imports it directly into the Enigma2 EPG cache.
 This OPKG package targets Python 2 based VTi 15/OE 2.0 images and uses the
 epg_new.dat import path on non-DreamOS receivers.
